# Test pairing allow list.
# Every entry must have a # [category] comment above its group.
# Entries without a category tag will fail the check.
#
# Regenerate: go tool task testpair ARGS=update
#
# Categories:
#   [multi-file]  subcommand files tested via main_test.go
#   [cross-pkg]   test covers symbols from a different package
#   [convention]  naming follows project convention, not strict Go idiom
#   [scenario]    integration/scenario test not tied to one symbol
